        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "width": "half",
            "text": "<p>What should have been, is.</p><p>when people first used a stick to draw on the ground.</p><p>The link between stationery and people began. The link, time and again, has continued to evolve along with the evolution of people, and continues to exist today.</p><p>However, its intended purpose has never changed.</p><p>We are now rethinking this evolution. Eliminating unnecessary ornamentation and function, we are taking a new look at what’s really necessary, rediscovering essential elements and aiming to finally arrive at what should have existed all along.</p><p>Stationery, standard & technology.</p>"
          }
